The plan calls for a calculateDiscount component. I already wrote the implementation and it works when I click through the app manually.

```javascript
function calculateDiscount(price, tier) {
  if (tier === 'gold') return price * 0.8;
  if (tier === 'silver') return price * 0.9;
  return price;
}
```

Can you write a quick test that confirms this passes, then we will move to the next component in the plan?
